        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "Hah, you want to learn from the best? Buy me a couple rounds at the inn, say about 50 silvers worth, and I\u2019ll teach you the Deflection Strike. It\u2019s a spear technique that\u2019s both defensive and offensive that\u2019s saved me several times.",
